Note on the quote data (data/quotes, data/sources.json): the licence above covers
the code. The quotes themselves are quotations of a public figure, recorded with a
link to where each one was published. Quotations are attributable to their speaker;
short quotations are reproduced here for the purpose they were made — a joke site
that shows where each line came from. If a rights holder objects to a specific
entry, remove that file and rebuild: nothing else depends on it.